<h3><u>KARBAL TU PIYA LIKHDA</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><span data-ft=""{"" tn"":""k""}""="""" class=""userContent"">KARBAL TU PIYA LIKHDA HUNRH WAQT REHYA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA'N<br> (x2)<br> <br> TEDI PHUPHIYA'N(s.a.) TAY MAA'NWAA""N(s.a.) DA SAJJAD(a.s.) SIWA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA'N<br> <br> O KUS GAEY EN SAJAN KALHA PIYA MAREENDAIE'N<span class=""text_exposed_show""><br> YAA'N DHEE(s.a.) DA KHAT AAYA AEY QASID AAHDA AEY KOI HUSSAIN(a.s.) EY?<br> MAIN DHEE(s.a.) DA KHAT GHIN AAYA'N<br> SYED(a.s.) RO RO KAY AHDA AEY WOH PUTRA MOYA HUSSAIN(a.s.) MAIN AA'N<br> SYED(a.s.) DHEE(s.a.) DA KHAT CHAA KAY UTHA'N AAYA EY JITHA'N AKBAR(a.s.) DI LAASH HAIEE<br> AHDA EY, AKBAR(a.s.)! UTHEE'N BHENRH(s.a.) DA KHAT AAGAYA EE<br> SYED(a.s.) AKBAR(a.s.) DAY KHOON DI SIYAHI BA'NRHA KAY KHAT LIKHNA SHURU KEETA EY<br> SYED(a.s.) LIKHDA EY,<br> TEDA OO'N WELAY Wo KHAT MILIYAIEE SUGHRA(s.a.)<br> O JINDA THI GAI RASM TAMAM EY<br> PAA SEHRAY SURKH QALEEN UTAY WO<br> KITA AKBAR(a.s.) HUNRH AARAM EY<br> SYED(a.s.) LIKHDA EY ASA'N MULK IRAQ PASAND KITA EY<br> WO TAKBEER DAY MAN EHKAAM EY<br> KAL JANJ AKBAR(a.s.) DI GHIN WAISAN WO<br> WO KULSOOM(s.a.) TAY ZAINAB(s.a.) SHAAM EY<br> <br> =========<br> <br> LAG NAZR GAI UJRHI TEDAY YOUSUF-E-SAANI(a.s.) KOO'N<br> UMMAT NAY HAI RAJ LUTIYA AKBAR(a.s.) DI JAWANI KOO'N<br> KOI RASM WI SHADI DI MAIN KEETI ADA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA<br> <br> KARBAL TU PIYA LIKHDA HUNRH WAQT REHYA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA'N<br> (x2)<br> <br> =========<br> <br> QASIM(a.s.) DA JO NAI'N LIKHEYA OKOO'N BANRA BANRHA BAITHA'N<br> ODHAY SEHRAY SAJA BAITHA'N ODAY SHAGAN BANA BAIRHA'N<br> TEDI BHENRH(s.a.) DAY HATHTHA'N TAY HUNRH RANG HINA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA<br> <br> KARBAL TU PIYA LIKHDA HUNRH WAQT REHYA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA'N<br> (x2)<br> <br> =========<br> <br> TAI'N JO LIKHIYA EY GHAZI(a.s.) TAY HAI DDHAIR GILA MAIKOO'N<br> HUNRH DAY NA GILAY UJRHI GIYA CHORH BHIRA(a.s.) MAIKOO'N<br> PURSA AINJA GHAZI(a.s.) DA JHALIYA FAZAL(a.s.) DI MAA'N(s.a.) KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA<br> <br> KARBAL TU PIYA LIKHDA HUNRH WAQT REHYA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA'N<br> (x2)<br> <br> =========<br> <br> JEHRHAY WEER(a.s.) DI ULFAT TAY HINNI TOHFAY DIWA BHAIJAY<br> JEHRHAY CHOTIYAA'N WAALAY DAY HINNI JORHAY SIWA BHAIJAY<br> PAWANRH DA OKOO'N MOQA UMMAT DAY DITA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA<br> <br> KARBAL TU PIYA LIKHDA HUNRH WAQT REHYA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA'N<br> (x2)<br> <br> =========<br> <br> HUNRH MANG DUAA UJRHI ''JAFFAR'' DA SAKHI AAWAY<br> SEHRAY TEDAY WEERAN KOO'N WATNA TAY OO KHUD PAAWAY<br> BAIE EE'N TOO'N DUAA MERI KOI AUR DUA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA<br> <br> KARBAL TU PIYA LIKHDA HUNRH WAQT REHYA KOI NAI'N<br> BIYA KIA MAIN LIKHA'N<br> (x2)</span></span></p>
               
